"{total}. Obrigado por comprar em {site_name}!"

#: includes/pro/class-kanasta-pro-notify.php:61
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_name}! We are waiting for the payment of your order "
"*#{order_number}* ({total}). Let us know if you need the payment details."
msgstr ""
"Olá {customer_name}! Estamos aguardando o pagamento do seu pedido "
"*#{order_number}* ({total}). Avise se precisar dos dados para pagamento."

#: includes/pro/class-kanasta-pro-notify.php:62
msgid ""
"Hi {customer_name}! Your order *#{order_number}* is on its way to "
